@startuml
[*] --> Logged In : User Login
Logged In --> Journey Details Viewed : Destination Selection
Journey Details Viewed --> Driving Mode Activated : Activate Driving Mode
Journey Details Viewed --> Place Selected for Eating : Select Place to Eat
Driving Mode Activated --> Accident Occurred : Accident Occurrence
Place Selected for Eating --> Order Placed : Place Order
Accident Occurred --> Journey Completed : Inform Authorities and Send Notifications
Journey Completed --> [*] : Final State

@enduml
